  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A bicycle of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span> comes to rest from speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> using the back brake. The brake has a specific heat capacity of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"c\"></span> and a mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span>. Half of the kinetic energy is absorbed by the brake.</p>\n<p>What is the change in temperature of the brake?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Mv^{2}}{4mc}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Mv^{2}}{2mc}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mv^{2}}{4Mc}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mv^{2}}{2Mc}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
